# Evidence records and exported assets are verified by SHA256 of raw bytes.
# Existing files contain both CRLF and LF. Never normalize them during add or
# checkout: that would invalidate evidence and snapshot hashes after cloning.
# -text disables newline conversion; ordinary text diffs remain available.
* -text
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary

